## The board

`boards/korvo1` runs the same model on the ESP32-S31-Korvo-1's 800x480 touch panel. The board port,
PRISM and the Bluetooth headset come from
[prism-esp32](https://github.com/PRISM-GUI/prism-esp32), a submodule at
`subprojects/prism-esp32`.

Get it, with its own PRISM checkout, then build and flash:

```sh
git submodule add https://github.com/PRISM-GUI/prism-esp32.git subprojects/prism-esp32
git submodule update --init --recursive
. /path/to/esp-idf/export.sh
scripts/build.sh     # build/{{ project_slug }}.bin
scripts/flash.sh     # or scripts/flash.sh /dev/ttyUSB0
```

The console is at 921600 baud. `boards/korvo1/sdkconfig.defaults` carries the board's settings;
`idf.py -C boards/korvo1 menuconfig` changes them.

